{"_src":{"A nice card was chosen for his mother by John on Mother's Day.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Be careful while getting off the train. The ground is wet.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Beijing is the capital of China.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Canada has ten provinces.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Computers are super calculators; we usually call them electronic brains.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","He grows cabbages on his farm.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","He went to Canada several years ago. Now he is a Canadian citizen.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","I don't care whether he comes or not.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","I gave him a phone call yesterday.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","I think everybody should just calm down.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","It's known to all that careless drivers are a danger to both themselves and others.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Little Tom was sleeping while everybody else was listening to the teacher carefully.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Mike's mother bought him a big cake on his birthday.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","My brother has studied in a university in Canada for three years. He will come back to China next week.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","My son likes reading stories. Now he can tell a story as well as his sister.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Now a camera does not cost much and most young people are certainly able to pay for it.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Please call me when you get home.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Rafe Esquith is called the most interesting classroom teacher in the U.S.A.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Shall we join in the Green World Summer Camp?":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","The Canadian won the championship in this event at the Olympics.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","The capital of Hainan Province is Haikou.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","The charity called for immediate action to help homeless pets.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","The sea is now calm.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","They brought all the necessary supplies to camp comfortably in the wilderness.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","This can holds five litres of water.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Tom Zhu is a captain.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","We needn't hurry all the way to the airport; the flight was cancelled because of the foggy weather.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","We went into the café for coffee and dessert yesterday.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","What terrible news it is! Three people died in the car accident.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text","Without great care, the old man's condition may become even worse.":"google:en-GB-Neural2-A:text"},"a":{"A nice card was chosen for his mother by John on Mother's Day.":"","Be careful while getting off the train. The ground is wet.":"","Beijing is the capital of China.":"","Canada has ten provinces.":"","Computers are super calculators; we usually call them electronic brains.":"","He grows cabbages on his farm.":"","He went to Canada several years ago. Now he is a Canadian citizen.":"","I don't care whether he comes or not.":"","I gave him a phone call yesterday.":"","I think everybody should just calm down.":"","It's known to all that careless drivers are a danger to both themselves and others.":"","Little Tom was sleeping while everybody else was listening to the teacher carefully.":"","Mike's mother bought him a big cake on his birthday.":"","My brother has studied in a university in Canada for three years. He will come back to China next week.":"","My son likes reading stories. Now he can tell a story as well as his sister.":"","Now a camera does not cost much and most young people are certainly able to pay for it.":"","Please call me when you get home.":"","Rafe Esquith is called the most interesting classroom teacher in the U.S.A.":"","Shall we join in the Green World Summer Camp?":"","The Canadian won the championship in this event at the Olympics.":"","The capital of Hainan Province is Haikou.":"","The charity called for immediate action to help homeless pets.":"","The sea is now calm.":"","They brought all the necessary supplies to camp comfortably in the wilderness.":"","This can holds five litres of water.":"","Tom Zhu is a captain.":"","We needn't hurry all the way to the airport; the flight was cancelled because of the foggy weather.":"","We went into the café for coffee and dessert yesterday.":"","What terrible news it is! Three people died in the car accident.":"","Without great care, the old man's condition may become even worse.":""}}
